<title>USA: United Water investments add $0.14/shr in Q1.</title>
<headline>United Water investments add $0.14/shr in Q1.</headline>
<dateline>HARRINGTON PARK, N.J. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Water Resources said Tuesday that its core utility investments, including its Northumbrian Partnership, contributed $0.14 a share to first quarter earnings, compared with $0.10 a share first quarter last year.</p>
<p>United Water reported first quarter earnings from continuing operations of $0.12 a share versus $0.16 a share.</p>
<p>Last year, United Water and Lyonnaise des Eaux-Dumez formed a partnership to take a 20 percent stake in Northumbrian Water Group Plc.</p>
</text>
